############################################################
# FIGURE 3 — Genomic architecture of PARPi resistance
#
# FINAL VERSION
#
# PANEL A:
#   Split into:
#     1. BRCA context
#        - BRCA_germline
#        - BRCA somatic
#
#     2. BRCAwt
#
#   Each split has:
#     stacked cohort bar on the LEFT
#     patient heatmap on the RIGHT
#
#   Stacked bars run RIGHT -> LEFT.
#
#   PRA row retained.
#   BRCA context row retained directly underneath PRA.
#
# Patient ordering:
#   Dynamically calculated separately within each
#   BRCA-context subgroup.
#
# Ordering states:
#   BRCA reversion
#   POST-CN_loss
#   POST-CN_gain
#   POST-loss-SNV
#   POST-gain-SNV
#
# Pre-existing CN, Shared SNV and No event:
#   excluded from patient ordering.
#
# IMPORTANT PLOTTING FIXES:
#   - Summary and heatmap use the SAME panel row structure.
#   - Cohort bars therefore align exactly with gene rows.
#   - PRA is explicitly populated from patient_architecture.
############################################################


